---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ApplyForm from '../components/ApplyForm.astro';
---

<Layout>

<header class="nav">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand">
      <a href="/" style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; text-decoration:none;">
        <img src="/assets/ggn-logo-navy.png" alt="Gain Global Networking mark" />
        <div class="wordmark">GAIN <span class="global">GLOBAL</span><br />NETWORKING</div>
      </a>
    </div>
    <nav class="links">
      <a href="#difference">Why Gain Global</a>
      <a href="#values">Values</a>
      <a href="#membership">Membership</a>
      <a href="#team">Leadership</a>
      <a href="#apply">Get In Touch</a>
    </nav>
    <a href="#apply" class="btn btn-cta">Visit a Meeting — Free</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">A Referral Networking Community</div>
    <h1>Networking that's actually <span class="lime">different</span>.</h1>
    <p class="lead editorial">Gain Global Networking is built on consistency and accountability — the two things that turn a room of strangers into deep relationships, lasting referral partners, and lifelong friends.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#apply" class="btn btn-primary">Visit a Meeting — Free</a>
      <a href="#difference" class="btn btn-secondary on-navy">See What Makes Us Different</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-meeting">
      <span class="dot"></span>
      <span>We meet every Tuesday, <strong>7:15 AM</strong> — Original Pancake House - Plano (121/DNT). 5760 State Hwy 121, STE 125, Plano TX 75024. Visitors always welcome, no fee to attend. <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/Aoz7Yb8LQTUvoJCA6" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-link">Click Here for directions</a></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="descriptor-strip">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span>Give</span><span class="sep">|</span><span>Grow</span><span class="sep">|</span><span>Gain</span>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section" id="difference">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">
      <span class="num">01</span>
      <h2>Most networking is transactional. Ours isn't.</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lead">A business card exchange doesn't build a business. Consistency builds relationships. Accountability builds trust. That's the whole model.</p>

    <div class="diff-grid">
      <div class="diff-card no">
        <h3>Typical Networking</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Random, one-off events</li>
          <li>Surface-level introductions</li>
          <li>No follow-through expected</li>
          <li>Transactional exchanges</li>
          <li>Easy come, easy go</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="diff-card yes">
        <h3>Gain Global Networking</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Weekly meetings, every Tuesday at 7:15 AM</li>
          <li>Visitors always welcome, no fee to attend</li>
          <li>One exclusive seat per profession</li>
          <li>Monthly 1-on-1s to build real relationships</li>
          <li>Accountability built into the structure</li>
          <li>A true community, not a contact list</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="formula">
      <div class="label">The Formula</div>
      <div class="formula-row">
        <span>Consistency</span><span class="plus">+</span><span>Accountability</span><span class="eq">=</span><span>Growth</span>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-outputs">
        <span class="chip">Deep Relationships</span>
        <span class="chip">Lasting Referral Partners</span>
        <span class="chip">Trusted Vendors</span>
        <span class="chip">Lifelong Friends</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="quote-block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="mark-quote">&ldquo;</div>
    <p class="big">You don't need to know how to do everything — you need to know who can. Gain Global Networking is where you find your "who."</p>
    <p class="attribution">Who, Not How</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section white" id="values">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">
      <span class="num">02</span>
      <h2>Core Values</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lead">Four principles guide every meeting, every member interaction, and every referral.</p>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-card">
        <h4>Integrity</h4>
        <p>We do what we say. Referrals only go to people we'd trust with our own name.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <h4>Philanthropy</h4>
        <p>Every chapter gives back — a share of dues goes straight to a cause the room picks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <h4>Compassion</h4>
        <p>Ask for what you need. Someone in the room can help, no explanation required.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <h4>Unity</h4>
        <p>One profession, one seat, one table — we win by showing up for each other.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="membership">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">
      <span class="num">03</span>
      <h2>Ways to be part of Gain Global</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lead">From an occasional visit to a full chapter seat — pick the level that fits how involved you want to be.</p>
    <div class="tier-grid">
      <div class="tier-card">
        <div class="tier-name">Supporter</div>
        <ul class="tier-list">
          <li>Access to the member database</li>
          <li>Up to 1x/quarter at a member's chapter (one location per membership)</li>
          <li>Networking welcome — no business pitch or spotlight</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="tier-card featured">
        <div class="tier-name">Member</div>
        <ul class="tier-list">
          <li>Access to the member database</li>
          <li>Exclusive seat in the chapter — one per profession</li>
          <li>75% minimum monthly attendance</li>
          <li>Referral, visitor, and 1-2-1 requirements</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="tier-card">
        <div class="tier-name">&ldquo;Cause&rdquo; Chair Member</div>
        <ul class="tier-list">
          <li>Exclusive philanthropy seat in the chapter</li>
          <li>12-month term, maximum</li>
          <li>One renewal max, by membership committee vote</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="tier-card">
        <div class="tier-name">Sponsor</div>
        <ul class="tier-list">
          <li>Annual sponsor of chapter philanthropy events</li>
          <li>Access to the member database</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section white" id="team">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">
      <span class="num">04</span>
      <h2>Meet the people behind Gain Global</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="team-grid">
      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="avatar">PS</div>
        <h4>Patrick Sweeney</h4>
        <div class="role">President</div>
      </div>
      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="avatar">TA</div>
        <h4>Terri Abellera</h4>
        <div class="role">Vice President</div>
        <div class="role2">Member Host</div>
      </div>
      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="avatar">SD</div>
        <h4>Star Darjuan</h4>
        <div class="role">Secretary</div>
        <div class="role2">Education Coordinator</div>
      </div>
      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="avatar">FA</div>
        <h4>Fernando Abellera</h4>
        <div class="role">Treasurer</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="apply">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="apply">
      <div class="apply-top">
        <div>
          <h3>Want to learn more?</h3>
          <p>Tell us a little about yourself and we'll follow up with everything you need to know — meeting details, what membership looks like, and how to get involved. No application, no pressure.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions" style="margin-top:24px;">
            <a href="#name" class="btn btn-primary">Get In Touch</a>
            <a href="#membership" class="btn btn-secondary on-navy">See Ways to Get Involved</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ApplyForm />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section white" id="meeting">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">
      <span class="num">05</span>
      <h2>Next Meeting</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lead">Visitors are always welcome, and there's never a fee to attend — come see what Gain Global Networking is about.</p>
    <div class="meeting-card">
      <div class="meeting-date">
        <div class="month">Every</div>
        <div class="day">TUE</div>
      </div>
      <div class="meeting-info">
        <div class="visitor-tag">Visitors Welcome &middot; No Fee</div>
        <h4>Original Pancake House - Plano (121/DNT)</h4>
        <p>Tuesdays &middot; 7:15 AM</p>
        <p>5760 State Hwy 121, STE 125, Plano TX 75024</p>
        <p>Visitors always welcome, no fee to attend.</p>
        <p>Bring your 90-second intro and be ready to find your "who."</p>
        <div class="hero-actions" style="margin-top:18px;">
          <a href="#apply" class="btn btn-primary">Visit a Meeting — Free</a>
          <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/Aoz7Yb8LQTUvoJCA6" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary">Click Here for directions</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand">
      <img src="/assets/ggn-logo-navy.png" alt="Gain Global Networking mark" style="width:28px;" />
      <div class="wordmark">GAIN <span style="color:var(--lime);">GLOBAL</span> NETWORKING</div>
    </div>
    <div class="foot-links">
      <a href="#difference">Why Gain Global</a>
      <a href="#membership">Membership</a>
      <a href="#team">Leadership</a>
      <a href="#apply">Get In Touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="foot-bottom">
      <span class="fine">&copy; 2026 Gain Global Networking. Visitors always welcome — no fee to attend.</span>
      <span class="descriptor">GIVE | GROW | GAIN</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

</Layout>
